OL,3,GNEWSAGroup forced entry and stole dog,
OL,4,Asay police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of people have broken into a
OL,7,Fkennel and stolen a beige lurcher dog,
OL,8,Faccording to Kent Police.
OL,10,FOfficers said it was reported that a
OL,11,Fgroup "forced entry" to a farm on Rye
OL,12,FLane near Sevenoaks, stole the dog and
OL,13,Fleft in a silver car between 22:15 and
OL,14,F23:30 BST on 31 August.
OL,16,F"An investigation is under way and
OL,17,Fpolice are not ruling out the
OL,18,Fpossibility that this theft may be
OL,19,Flinked to other similar incidents in
OL,20,Fthe Sevenoaks area," said a force
OL,21,Fspokesperson.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
